    "Änderungen an %s verwerfen, um eine andere Datei zu öffnen?")
/* The same question after SAVE found the file changed on the card since
 * the editor read it (the Wi-Fi page wrote it): STAY keeps the text, READ
 * AGAIN in DISCARD's place reads the file anew, and OVERWRITE behind a 2s
 * hold replaces the file as it is on the card now.  The Wi-Fi page's editor
 * asks it with the same three words. */
UI_TEXT(ED_Q_CHANGED, 0,
