    "Touch signal lost while switching to ARMED. Stopped.",
    "Touch-Signal beim Wechsel zu ARMED verloren. Gestoppt.")
/* Screen rotation 180° fell back: the copy into the frame buffer timed out
 * or failed (gfx_turn.h).  Raised by the render loop. */
