    "Touchscreen antwortet nicht mehr. Auf SAFE geschaltet.")
/* An ARM or an ON refused while a STOP an operator pressed stands, in place
 * of the action's own reason (panel_arm.c, panel_supply.c). */
UI_TEXT(ALERT_STOP_HELD, 94,
    "STOP pressed: hold STOP 2s to reset.",
    "STOP gedrückt: Halte STOP 2s, um ihn zurückzusetzen.")
/* The reset's hold completed and the IOmcu did not confirm within
 * STOP_LATCH_CONFIRM_MS (stop_latch.h): the latch stands. */
UI_TEXT(ALERT_STOP_NO_CONFIRM, 94,
    "STOP not reset: the IOmcu did not report every output off within 2s.",
    "STOP nicht gelöst: Der IOmcu meldete nicht binnen 2s alle Ausgänge aus.")
/* The render loop stood still for FRAME_WATCH_MS (frame_watch.h) on an
 * ARMED bench or under a live supply output; shown once it draws again. */
UI_TEXT(ALERT_SCREEN_STALLED, 94,
    "Screen stopped updating for 1s. Switched to SAFE, output off.",
